'''DL Anniv. Doge Cake''' is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy found in celebration events that appear when the game reaches a certain download milestone, starting from [[Joy of 20 Million!|20 Million Downloads Special Gift!]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]]. Its appearance changes for every 10 million downloads.

