==Enemy==
An enemy with lackluster stats, it serves no threat and can be easily defeated. It does have a Metal trait to it, however.

==Strategy==
Using [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] will defeat it quickly and efficiently. A [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] such as [[Merc (Special Cat)|Merc]], [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] or [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Million-Dollar Cat]] can help you be rid of it sooner, but with 1 damage, virtually anything can defeat it in the end.

